          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 style="margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem;">Recommendations</h5>
            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--mo-text-muted);">✔️ Life Insurance</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--mo-text-muted);">✔️ Health Insurance</div>
